Good day, our esteemed viewers.

3
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Îro, xelekeke nû ya bernameya me ye, bernameya Gundên Welat.
 
Today, it's a new episode of our program, the Villages of
the Homeland program.

4
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Ez im Rûliyan Hec Ehmed bi gel we me û em ê bi hev ra
seredana gundekî nû bikin.
 
I am Ruliyan Hec Ahmed, I am with you, and together we will
visit a new village.

5
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Gundê me îro ji du beşên pêk tê. Beşa yekemîn bi navê
Keferdelê Jorîn e, ew di çiyayê da ava bûye.
 
Our village today consists of two parts. The first part is
called Upper Keferdela, which was built in the mountain.

6
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Û beşa duyemîn bi navê Keferdelê Jêrîn e, ew jî li deşta
Cûmê hatiye avakirin.
 
And the second part is called Lower Keferdela, which was
built in the Cume plain.

7
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Lê em ê bi hev ra derbasî gundê Keferdelê Jorîn bibin, ji
ber ku gelekî kevnare û beriya 500 sal hatiye avakirin.
 
But we will together enter the village of Upper Keferdela,
because it is very ancient and was built 500 years ago.

8
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Ji bo ku em gund ji nêzîk va nas bikin û ku em bizanibin
çilo derê heye, bi me re biçin, bi me ra bin û li me temaşe
bikin.
 
In order for us to get to know the village up close and to
know what is there, go with us, be with us, and watch us.

