Mashallah. Well, why didn't you teach at school, for
example, why didn't you become a teacher?

21
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:51,000
Êê... li ser kul halin. Mesela wisane.
 
Uh... in any case. The issue is like this.

22
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:58,000
Almuhim, hal pir safî ne, pirjî bi îtibarê milkê dar bi tenê
