Do you have a shop business where people come and buy?

25
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:07,000
Em nane mescid darketê basîs.
 
We go to the mosque just around the corner.

26
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,000
Hemdûllah.
 
Thank God.

27
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:10,000
Te çend sal e kar kir di saziyê de?
 
How many years did you work in the institution?

28
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:13,000
Sê û sê sal e li camî'a.
 
Thirty-three years at the university.

29
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,000
Gerek teqawidî te derketibe.
 
Your retirement must have come out.

30
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:18,000
Teqawidî te derketiye teb'en. Min şeş şeş meh teqawidî
digirim.
 
Retirement has come out of course. I get retirement every
six months.

31
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:20,000
Te got te li Helebê kar dikir?
 
You said you worked in Aleppo?

32
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:26,000
Min li Helebê kar dikir, min du zarok li pey min çêbû, ez ma
me çûbûm Helebê.
 
I worked in Aleppo, I had two children, I stayed and went to
Aleppo.

33
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,000
